{# Checklist Prompting: Mandatory pre-computation verification #}
Objective: {{ objective|default("Provide a highly accurate response by systematically verifying all requirements before answering.") }}

<checklist>
{% if checklist_items %}
{% for item in checklist_items %}
- [ ] {{ item }}
{% endfor %}
{% else %}
- [ ] Have I understood all aspects of the query?
- [ ] Have I verified all factual claims?
- [ ] Is my logic sound and free of fallacies?
- [ ] Have I considered edge cases and constraints?
- [ ] Is the response complete and well-structured?
{% endif %}
</checklist>

<query>
{{ user_input|default(query|default("")) }}
</query>

Instructions:
1. Process the query.
2. In the <checklist_execution> block, go through every item in the <checklist>. Change `[ ]` to `[x]` and provide a brief 1-sentence justification for why it passes.
3. Only after the checklist is complete, provide your final answer.

<checklist_execution>
Go through each checklist item and mark with [x] when complete with brief justification.
</checklist_execution>

<final_answer>
Your verified final answer after completing the checklist
</final_answer>
